-- ============================================================
-- Wisdom — 11-lesson course on the great books and teachers:
-- Atomic Habits, The Power of Now, A New Earth, The Greatest
-- Secret, Wealth Money Can't Buy, and the teachings of Jung,
-- Dispenza, Huberman and Watts. Original lessons on the ideas;
-- every source is cited in references_json with a Note entry,
-- and each practice is tiered honestly (the chip rates the
-- practice, not the worldview). Same shape as the Inner Work and
-- Longevity courses. Idempotent: ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING.
